{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22306","headline":"春葺新居 · 白居易","name":"春葺新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江州司马日，忠州刺史时。\n栽松满後院，种柳荫前墀。\n彼皆非吾土，栽种尚忘疲。\n况兹是我宅，葺艺固其宜。\n平旦领仆使，乘春亲指挥。\n移花夹暖室，徙竹覆寒池。\n池水变绿色，池芳动清辉。\n寻芳弄水坐，尽日心熙熙。\n一物苟可适，万缘都若遗。\n设如宅门外，有事吾不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}